  solution: "Phương pháp:\nCSC $(u_n)$: $u_n = u_1 + (n-1)d$. Tổng: $S_n = frac(n(u_1+u_n), 2)$. Tính chất: $u_k = frac(u_(k-1)+u_(k+1), 2)$.\n\n-  begin{eqnarray*}\n\t\t\tu_3+u_5=10\n\t\t\t&Leftrightarrow& u_1+2d+u_1+4d=10\n\n\t\t\t&Leftrightarrow& 2u_1+6d=10\n\n\t\t\t&Leftrightarrow& 4+6d=10\n\n\t\t\t&Leftrightarrow& d=1.\n\t\tend{eqnarray*}",
